class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p$\">$p$</span> when <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(\\nabla _X X)(p)=0$\">$(\\nabla _X X)(p)=0$</span>. The velocity field of a geodesic satisfies this condition along the geodesic. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-2-8-geodesic","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#lem:dc-ch6-2-9-existence","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-2-induced-connection","title":"def:dc-ch6-2-induced-connection","label":"def:dc-ch6-2-induced-connection"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-2-8-geodesic","title":"def:dc-ch6-2-8-geodesic","label":"def:dc-ch6-2-8-geodesic"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#lem:dc-ch6-2-9-existence","title":"lem:dc-ch6-2-9-existence","label":"lem:dc-ch6-2-9-existence"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#prop:dc-ch6-2-9","title":"prop:dc-ch6-2-9","label":"prop:dc-ch6-2-9"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#lem:dc-ch6-2-9-field","title":"lem:dc-ch6-2-9-field","label":"lem:dc-ch6-2-9-field"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-2-9-geodesic-field","title":"def:dc-ch6-2-9-geodesic-field","tex":"\\begin{definition}[geodesic field at a point]\n  \\label{def:dc-ch6-2-9-geodesic-field}\n\n  \\uses{def:dc-ch6-2-induced-connection, def:dc-ch6-2-8-geodesic}\n\n  A tangent field $X\\in\\mathcal{X}(U)$ is a \\emph{geodesic field at} $p$ when\n  $(\\nabla_X X)(p)=0$. The velocity field of a geodesic satisfies this condition\n  along the geodesic.\n\\end{definition}","source":"tex/references/DoC